    "text": "<blockquote><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/b9b58987-c936-48a8-a1c6-7e085772704f-image.png\" style=\"width: 272px; height: 300px;\" /></p><p>Since diazonium ion is a cation hence it is<br />stabilized by electron donating groups and<br />destabilized by electron withdrawing group.<br />Hence Stability order should be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>.</p></blockquote>",
